        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator that is a translation product of some mRNA whose exon structure and start site selection renders it capable of giving rise to a protein with the amino acid sequence represented by UniProtKB:P13569-2 or a 1:1 ortholog thereof.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pr.owl"/>
